ion>The ended stop code's start date (month/day/year, in the user's time zone).</description><dataType>String</dataType><expression>TEXT(MONTH(DATEVALUE({!LoopThroughEndedStopCodes.EffectiveDate}))) &amp; "/" &amp; TEXT(DAY(DATEVALUE({!LoopThroughEndedStopCodes.EffectiveDate}))) &amp; "/" &amp; TEXT(YEAR(DATEVALUE({!LoopThroughEndedStopCodes.EffectiveDate})))</expression></formulas><formulas><name>forT_EndedEnd</name><description>The date the stop code ended (month/day/year, in the user's time zone). Blank when it was ended without a date (12/31/4000).</description><dataType>String</dataType><expression>IF(YEAR(DATEVALUE({!LoopThroughEndedStopCodes.ValidUntilDate})) &gt;= 4000, "", TEXT(MONTH(DATEVALUE({!LoopThroughEndedStopCodes.ValidUntilDate}))) &amp; "/" &amp; TEXT(DAY(DATEVALUE({!LoopThroughEndedStopCodes.ValidUntilDate}))) &amp; "/" &amp; TEXT(YEAR(DATEVALUE({!LoopThroughEndedStopCodes.ValidUntilDate}))))</expression></formulas><formulas><name>forT_Display</name><description>The two tables shown on the page (open stop codes first, then ended ones), or a note when the account has none.</description><dataType>String</dataType><expression>IF({!varN_OpenCount} = 0 &amp;&amp; {!varN_EndedCount} = 0, "&lt;p&gt;No stop codes on this record.&lt;/p&gt;", "&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Open stop codes (" &amp; TEXT({!varN_OpenCount}) &amp; ")&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" &amp; IF({!varN_OpenCount} = 0, "&lt;p&gt;None.&lt;/p&gt;", "&lt;table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style='padding:4px 8px;text-align:left'&gt;Code&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='padding:4px 8px;text-align:left'&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='padding:4px 8px;text-align:left'&gt;Start date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;" &amp; {!varT_OpenRows} &amp; "&lt;/table&gt;") &amp; IF({!varN_EndedCount} = 0, "", "&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Ended stop codes (" &amp; TEXT({!varN_EndedCount}) &amp; ")&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table style='width:100%;border-collapse:collapse'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th style='padding:4px 8px;text-align:left'&gt;Code&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='padding:4px 8px;text-align:left'&gt;Description&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='padding:4px 8px;text-align:left'&gt;Start date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th style='padding:4px 8px;text-align:left'&gt;End date&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;" &amp; {!varT_EndedRows} &amp; "&lt;/table&gt;"))</expression></formulas><interviewLabel>Screen Flow: Account Stop Codes {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel><label>Screen Flow: Account Stop Codes</label><loops><name>LoopThroughOpenStopCodes</name><label>Loop Through Open Stop Codes</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><collectionReference>GetOpenStopCodes</collectionReference><iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder><nextValueConnector><targetReference>AddOpenRow</targetReference></nextValueConnector><noMoreValuesConnector><targetReference>GetEndedStopCodes</targetReference></noMoreValuesConnector></loops><loops><name>LoopThroughEndedStopCodes</name><label>Loop Through Ended Stop Codes</label><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><collectionReference>GetEndedStopCodes</collectionReference><iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder><nextValueConnector><targetReference>AddEndedRow</targetReference></nextValueConnector><noMoreValuesConnector><targetReference>ShowStopCodes</targetReference></noMoreValuesConnector></loops><processMetadataValues><name>BuilderType</name><value><stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processMetadataValues><name>CanvasMode</name><value><stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processMetadataValues><name>OriginBuilderType</name><value><stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processType>Flow</processType><recordLookups><name>GetOpenStopCodes</name><description>The account's open stop codes, newest first. Runs as the user: a user who can't read stop codes goes to the no-access message.</description><label>Get Open Stop Codes</la